WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back with knees bent and feet hip-width.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Press down to lift the hips and slide a block under the sacrum.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Rest the hips on the block; arms rest by the sides or in a cactus shape.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Soften the throat and jaw; breathe slowly.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
To exit, press into the feet, remove the block, and lower vertebra by vertebra.
